W: 1. O TRINITY, most blessèd Light,
W:    O Unity of sovereign might,
W:    As now the fiery sun departs,
W:    Pour thou thy beams within our hearts
W:
W: To you our morning song of praise,
W: to you our evening prayer we raise;
W: our humble joy shall ever be
W: to praise your name eternally.
W:
W: 3 To God the Father, heav&apos;nly light,
W: to Christ revealed in earthly night,
W: to God the Spirit let us raise
W: one heart and voice in ceaseless praise.
W:</miscellaneous-field>
